{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7773a52a-1b00-880f-b5eb-760c3f243b30",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T11:39:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:35:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, madam. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Moira McCarthy. I am calling about a problem with the water in the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where is the street, Ms. McCarthy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is Eustis Avenue, in the Historic Hill. The number is four thirty-three. I am sorry, I am on the speaker phone, my hands are not so good for holding the telephone. Can you hear me well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, tell me what's happening at 433 Eustis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:36:27-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a puddle, a big one, across half of the road. It does not go away. It is there many days already, and it has not rained since before the holidays. [pause] So I do not understand where the water comes from."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no rain, and it's still sitting there. Is it near a storm drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, there is the grate, the metal one, by the curb. I went out yesterday and I cleaned the leaves from it with my hands. I used gloves, of course. And it was good, the water went down. But only for ten minutes, maybe, and then it came back again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the grate itself was clear but it's still backing up. That could mean something's blocked further down the line. Is the water running from somewhere, like a leaking pipe, or is it just standing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] I am sorry, can you say again? The line, it is cutting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the water moving, like coming from somewhere, or is it just sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is just sitting, madam. It is very still. It is clear water, not dirty, only the leaves at the edge. And it covers half of the road, so the cars must go around it on the other side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at that drain and the line under it. Could be a clog, could be something with the pipe. Can I have a good number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is four, zero, one, five, five, five, zero, one, six, nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-nine. That's right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Thank you. May I ask one more thing? I am a person who has a small cleaning business, and right now I am between two houses, so I am not always at home. If I do not answer, please leave the message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we'll leave a message if we miss you. Anything else about the spot? Any cars getting stuck, anything unsafe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, only the puddle. Nobody is hurt. But I would like to ask you for a call back when it is done, please, so I know that it is fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. I'll note that on the order, call you back once the crew's finished. I can't promise you which day they'll get out there, but it's in the system now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. That is fine. Thank you very much for your help, madam. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. McCarthy. Have a good day, and stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
